{"2423020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kingdom Flipper", "steam_appid": 2423020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/46912a33059b7de9317b308b562a60d3.poster.avif?t=1755165922\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/46912a33059b7de9317b308b562a60d3.webm?t=1755165922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the king’s newest architect! Don’t worry about what happened to the one before - it’s your time to shine as the latest peasant to flip castles in the name of His Majesty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/739ef6a946963c2ead5885763c671dfe.poster.avif?t=1755165922\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/739ef6a946963c2ead5885763c671dfe.webm?t=1755165922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take drab huts and turn them into sprawling castles, fortresses and much more! Give new life to old stones by cleaning, repairing, rebuilding, painting and decorating medieval era buildings. Then flip them for profit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/8b2373608df57ec4bc87312c5161b867.poster.avif?t=1755165922\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/8b2373608df57ec4bc87312c5161b867.webm?t=1755165922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says castles have to be gray? Unleash your creativity on vast castles and strongholds. Experiment in Creative Mode or your own home fortress and create your dream castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/bbfa429dd679ec006fac16a4a587254b.poster.avif?t=1755165922\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/bbfa429dd679ec006fac16a4a587254b.webm?t=1755165922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t stay a lowly architect and make that coin! Take on royal jobs around the kingdom and build up your coffers to flip even bigger, grander castles.  Gather skill points and spend them on a variety of skills from cleaning to crafting and become a master architect your way.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/46912a33059b7de9317b308b562a60d3.poster.avif?t=1755165922\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/46912a33059b7de9317b308b562a60d3.webm?t=1755165922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become the king’s newest architect! Don’t worry about what happened to the one before - it’s your time to shine as the latest peasant to flip castles in the name of His Majesty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/739ef6a946963c2ead5885763c671dfe.poster.avif?t=1755165922\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/739ef6a946963c2ead5885763c671dfe.webm?t=1755165922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take drab huts and turn them into sprawling castles, fortresses and much more! Give new life to old stones by cleaning, repairing, rebuilding, painting and decorating medieval era buildings. Then flip them for profit!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/8b2373608df57ec4bc87312c5161b867.poster.avif?t=1755165922\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/8b2373608df57ec4bc87312c5161b867.webm?t=1755165922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who says castles have to be gray? Unleash your creativity on vast castles and strongholds. Experiment in Creative Mode or your own home fortress and create your dream castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/bbfa429dd679ec006fac16a4a587254b.poster.avif?t=1755165922\" width=600 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/extras/bbfa429dd679ec006fac16a4a587254b.webm?t=1755165922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t stay a lowly architect and make that coin! Take on royal jobs around the kingdom and build up your coffers to flip even bigger, grander castles.  Gather skill points and spend them on a variety of skills from cleaning to crafting and become a master architect your way.</p>", "short_description": "Peasants your time has come! Grab a broom and hammer, it’s time to flip castles! Take drab strongholds and transform them into palaces fit for royalty. Take jobs, buy land, and build your dream castle all for profit, of course!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/header.jpg?t=1755165922", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/f7ad48a8fa8587ad6101ac0dba30620768a3023b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755165922", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2423020/f7ad48a8fa8587ad6101ac0dba30620768a3023b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755165922", "website": "https://kingdomflipper.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5- 2400 CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 G